{% set title = "From Invisible to Indispensable: Launching Pulse" %}
{% set description = "<p>Pulse was our first major consumer-facing product. It started with a vision: make the chaos of home remodeling feel calm. From kickoff to launch, we ran rapid UX research, stripped away complexity, and shipped an experience customers love.</p><p>The dashboard became a daily ritual for thousands. With over 567k users and 13k+ deep engagements, Pulse changed how we connected with customers—and proved that internal systems can lead to external delight.</p><blockquote>&ldquo;Pulse didn't just track the project. It gave customers control.&rdquo;</blockquote>" %}
