{% set title = "Designed Around the User" %}
{% set description = "<p>We started with listening: interviews, surveys, field visits. Users wanted less jargon, more transparency, and fewer surprises. So we mapped every moment of the remodeling journey, designed flows around natural touchpoints, and shipped fast.</p><p>The result was a clean, mobile-first dashboard that let users preview doors, confirm details, and feel confident every step of the way. Pulse became a surprise delight in a space where expectations were low.</p>" %}
